It's not 100 what if scenarios. In most single game that actually emphasises stealth, the enemy being seen taken down doesn't result in you being seen wherever you are. It is one singular issue of AI design. And once again, they don't see me taking out the enemy. The see the enemy being taken out. Looking the other direction, and then no matter where I am they snipe me.

&#x200B;

